{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"7930e1fb303b8068bbeea81cf33d1b27a51b5c435156ca2e7e4b007ec2996b94","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016gQUBxi3pJeY1LZm8mmnxW","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  Left for the user: blood decals (the game keeps blood minimal - 3 puffs, no decals, not in the\n  README - a tone/rating call).\n","new_string":"  Left for the user: blood decals (the game keeps blood minimal - 3 puffs, no decals, not in the\n  README - a tone/rating call).\n- 4e81b2af hand grime (materials.js skin variant, after the close-up skK block): all skin within\n  3 m x(0.74,0.69,0.64) (faces 35% of that); hands = |vSkP.x| > 0.3-0.38 and vSkP.y < 1.2-1.3 in\n  the A-pose bind pose (hands measured at |x| 0.35-0.63, y 0.9-1.17; face |x| < 0.1, y 1.4-1.72):\n  mud smears (skNoise x28/x95) and flecks (x260), dark brown, roughness 0.7. Debug trick that\n  works: SKIN_UNIFORMS.uSkinDebug negative for a custom view (positive values trigger the existing\n  red/green skin/cloth overlays).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
