{"parentUuid":"6756816c-c18e-4774-a545-9c8d62199490","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGFbF92hKSAVC6FD2rzL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round added one commit to `hedgerow-grass`, not pushed: 4e81b2af, dirty hands on the rifle. Shaders compile on all three presets, node checks pass, and the merge with `hedgerow-poc` is still clean.\n\n- **The problem:** next to the now-worn rifle, the player's hands were an even, slightly plastic pink, the cleanest thing in Normandy.\n- **The fix:** within 3 m, all skin is a little darker and duller, as after days in the field.\n  - On the hands only, there are smears of mud a few centimetres across and flecks a few millimetres across, dark wet brown and rougher than the skin.\n  - The mud is placed by position on the soldier model, so it stays put on the hand however the hand moves.\n  - Faces, including an enemy's at arm's length, get only the lighter grime.\n- **Result:** under the street lamps the hands now look like a field soldier's; in firelight the effect is subtler.\n\nThis was material shading only, in `materials.js`; the first-person rig wasn't touched.\n\nAll test servers are stopped, no browser tabs are open, and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Notes are in the shared notes file."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":228,"cache_read_input_tokens":813505,"output_tokens":389,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":228,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":813505,"cache_creation_input_tokens":228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":228},"type":"message"}],"sp