{"parentUuid":"4c349f30-bc30-425c-9c05-1af80c132352","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_015duXkpv6pQnMLLtpQcc2j3","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4c8b7e44-93d7-4cbd-a5fa-2c369a788fd7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:34:09.338Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"4c8b7e44-93d7-4cbd-a5fa-2c369a788fd7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGFtX5xbiP6YF27NA58X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PvAXzeXZqQWSYpxkVDeWXX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='fun/hedgerow/README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    field: the skin a little darker and duller, the hands smeared and\n    flecked with mud; the guns within 2.5 m (the\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    field: the skin a little darker and duller, the hands smeared and\n    flecked with mud, the wool soaked darker in blotches where it faces the\n    rain and the sleeves muddied along the forearm, most at the cuff; the\n    guns within 2.5 m (the\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit diff --stat && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: sleeves soaked and muddied\n\nThe sleeves in first person are two of the largest shapes on the\nscreen, and they were a flat, even olive. Within 3 m, the wool (as the\nskin variant finds it) is now soaked darker in blotches where it faces\nthe sky, the rain's side, using the world normal. Along the forearm\nthe sleeves are muddied, more and more towards the cuff, which is\npicked out in the soldier's A-pose bind pose, with noise in bind-pose\nspace so the mud stays on the cloth. An enemy's uniform at arm's\nlength gets the same, and reads as field-worn, not patterned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merge with hedgerow-poc: clean\"","description":"Commit the sleeve wear and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":837364,"output_