{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"91df7802-aa7c-4584-b207-15daba7bc84c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:34:48.320Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"70d880a7-cef4-479b-aafc-0e16a69a5142","keep":1499,"tail":["f651ef8bd3cf514fdc9bfb8847895fc24105e100117e8ecab065dc452770fdec","e69242fd812c4869d75203e9c436e97f9510822f2652dc50105a3772fbba3da2","b518185c2c258010bd1e16117bd2563f36e7a545e99f09aafc81c2b6617714c0"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1501,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"48b31e13f52ff6cdabf963ef4ec3dd77dbb97c52a71fd6e0a80838a2b63e7f14"}
{"parentUuid":"8678e783-7a85-486a-b6a4-1e7c012b91b3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGFwwvXBdqTZ2SiXnqbe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round added one commit to `hedgerow-grass`, not pushed: 6010baa3, soaked and muddied sleeves. Shaders compile on all three presets, node checks pass, and the merge with `hedgerow-poc` is still clean.\n\n- **The problem:** the first-person sleeves are two of the largest shapes on screen, and they were a flat, even olive.\n- **The fix:** within 3 m:\n  - the wool is soaked darker in blotches wherever it faces the sky and the rain;\n  - the sleeves are muddied along the forearm, more and more toward the cuff;\n  - like the hand grime, it's placed by position on the soldier model, so it stays on the cloth as the arms move.\n- **Result:** it's subtle by design but breaks up the flat olive, and pairs with last round's dirty hands and worn rifle. An enemy seen from 2 m with the same wool looks field-worn, not patterned.\n\nThis was material shading only, in `materials.js`; the first-person rig wasn't touched.\n\nOne idea not built: bullet cracks in lit window panes. The game knows the panes per house model but has no world-space list, so it's a bigger job. It's written up in the shared notes.\n\nThe headless browser and preview server are stopped, no browser tabs are open, and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Stopping the browser threw an error removing its scratch profile folder, so I removed it by hand."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":249,"cache_read_input_tokens":842358,"output_tokens":461,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":249,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":