{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"be65c83753c921344034430d7ba217def4e39221c73198987b769530fee0be9c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The axis points forward, so the wisps do come off the front 40 cm of the barrel; seen from behind, that stretch just foreshortens toward the tip. Running the preset and node checks."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KRGjRcXmn6QDVYDSwKrxK9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd REDACTED && for q in low med high; do node hl.mjs eval q_set_$q.js >/dev/null 2>&1; for i in 1 2; do r=$(node hl.mjs eval boot.js 2>/dev/null); echo \"$r\" | grep -q '\"loaded\": true' && break; done; node hl.mjs eval helpers.js >/dev/null; echo \"== $q $(echo $r | tr -d ' \\n')\"; node hl.mjs eval q_chk2.js | tr -d ' \\n'; echo; done; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && for t in world route character ragdoll distance lod ai fp clutter; do printf \"%s: \" $t; node fun/hedgerow/tests/$t-check.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1; done","description":"Compile-check presets and run node checks","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
