{"parentUuid":"9887b828-b6da-4213-9982-12939ef90f9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGGG9jBSGvB6Ug9op5AP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XufuxBAXsZV6iM8Qg7yHdq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    solid lumps that tumble, knock off walls, bounce and lie where they\n    fall),\n    `audio.js` (procedural\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    solid lumps that tumble, knock off walls, bounce and lie where they\n    fall), `steam.js` (every shot heats the barrel of the gun in your\n    hands; the rain boils off it, so after a burst thin steam curls up off\n    its front and blows away on the wind, more the longer you fired,\n    thinning as it cools),\n    `audio.js` (procedural\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/js/steam.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: steam off a hot barrel in the rain\n\nAfter a burst in the rain, thin steam now curls up off the front of the\ngun in your hands and blows away on the wind, as rain-soaked rifles do\nin AAA wet-weather levels.\n\nNew steam.js keeps a barrel heat. Each of the player's shots adds to\nit (the 'shot' noise event, which only the player makes), and it\nhalves in about five seconds. While it is raining, it emits wisps along\nthe front 40 cm of the barrel, found through the rig's own muzzleWorld()\nand the weapon's z axis; nothing else of the first-person rig is\ntouched. More heat means more wisps that rise faster and show more.\nThe wisps are a new effects.steam(): small, faint, drawn out along\ntheir rise, curling, carried on the wind, and lit by the lamps and\nfires like the other smoke. Cleared on a retry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merge with hedgerow-poc: clean\"","description":"Commit the barrel steam and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":866280,"output_tokens":889,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":418,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":866280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":418,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":418},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XufuxBAXsZV6iM8Qg7yHdq":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    solid lumps that tumble, knock off walls, bounce and lie where they\n    fall),\n    `audio.js` (procedural\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    solid lumps that tumble, knock off walls, bounce and lie where they\n    fall), `steam.js` (every shot heats the barrel of the gun in your\n    hands; the rain boils off it, so after a burst thin steam curls up off\n    its front and blows away on the wind, more the longer you fired,\n    thinning as it cools),\n    `audio.js` (procedural\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/js/steam.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: steam off a hot barrel in the rain\n\nAfter a burst in the rain, thin steam now curls up off the front of the\ngun in your hands and blows away on the wind, as rain-soaked rifles do\nin AAA wet-weather levels.\n\nNew steam.js keeps a barrel heat. Each of the player's shots adds to\nit (the 'shot' noise event, which only the player makes), and it\nhalves in about five seconds. While it is raining, it emits wisps along\nthe front 40 cm of the barrel, found through the rig's own muzzleWorld()\nand the weapon's z axis; nothing else of the first-person rig is\ntouched. More heat means more wisps that rise faster and show more.\nThe wisps are a new effects.steam(): small, faint, drawn out along\ntheir rise, curling, carried on the wind, and lit by the lamps and\nfires like the other smoke. Cleared on a retry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merge with hedgerow-poc: clean\"","description":"Commit the barrel steam and check the merge"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01XufuxBAXsZV6iM8Qg7yHdq":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"35fce47e-bdac-400b-9069-8d0c8e09ceaa","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGGG8qMbB8TtUi5oFEne","requestRef":"24b290f1-23aa-4b13-a389-7b84aabf2664","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e09a1fab-d868-428e-8cf7-a196f05c78a5","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:39:04.010Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
