{"parentUuid":"1c3325ac-ff2a-4a79-877f-440f0f7af1fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGGKS4mrZDCk2mgA1JCu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round added one commit to `hedgerow-grass`, not pushed: 3a17285e, steam off a hot barrel in the rain. Shaders compile on all three presets, node checks pass, and the merge with `hedgerow-poc` is still clean.\n\n- **What you see:** after a burst in the rain, thin vapour curls up off the front of the gun in your hands and blows sideways on the wind. It's like the rain-soaked rifles in AAA wet-weather levels. A clip's worth of shots keeps it steaming for about 8 seconds.\n- **How it works:** a new `steam.js` tracks how hot the barrel is. Each of your shots adds heat, which halves in about five seconds, and while it's raining it releases wisps along the front 40 cm of the barrel.\n  - It follows the gun through the rig's own muzzle position and the weapon's long axis, and changes nothing else of the first-person rig. Both exist on `hedgerow-poc` too.\n  - It's cleared when you retry the mission.\n- **Tuning:** my first version made round puffs that read as gun smoke. Smaller wisps stretched along their rise read as vapour.\n\nThe headless browser and preview server are stopped, no browser tabs are open, and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Notes are in the shared notes file."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":869592,"output_tokens":430,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":869592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_creation":{"ephem