{"parentUuid":"bc56aaa6-3a0e-431d-99ae-17af3cfacc05","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Stop hook feedback:\n[constantly and iteratively improve the game graphics towards aaa game (call of duty, medal of honor). commit each improvement.]: The condition requires constantly and iteratively improving the game graphics toward AAA quality (Call of Duty / Medal of Honor) with no finish point. The transcript shows committed improvements (e.g. 81e11279 'muzzle flashes and blasts cast shadows'), but each round ends with a wrap-up and teardown ('All test servers are stopped... no browser tabs are open'), so the work is not a sustained, open-ended loop. Nothing in the transcript measures the game against a Call of Duty or Medal of Honor standard; the improvements are judged against the game's own earlier state. The open-ended goal is therefore not shown to be satisfied."},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"a7f3609c-c844-46d8-95b4-249d141338e2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:53:20.236Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
