{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"fbea6158ef7b73974c867f3879d23846f3660f429aa6bf617b5c7f0ab62bb3bf","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The initial white-hot fireball, flash sprite, and bloom are overpowering the small dark earth column beneath them, making it read as a pure white orb. I'll check how effects.js handles its late render pass to see if the dirt can be drawn over the fireball.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JSwRNvXU5hPN85pP2wdZ9b","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && sed -n \"$(grep -n '  function usePass' js/effects.js | cut -d: -f1),+40p\" js/effects.js && grep -n \"lateScene\\|late\\b\\|late:\" js/effects.js | head -20 && grep -n \"fireballs.drawLate\\|G.fireballs\" js/main.js | head","description":"Read the effects pass and late pass wiring"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
