{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"02f78a28ef0a42b1866a1db84bb392749562e5df7c8a0a7d33230108e80b0671","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice panes crack but no shards fly off when hit, unlike in games like Call of Duty. I'll wire a hook from the glass hit decal into effects.js to spawn a shower of shards.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C2eqzRYWBpGdCyRcG59RbR","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Look at reference frames from CoD Vanguard's Normandy night","status":"completed"},{"content":"Add glass shards when a lit pane is hit","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Verify the shards on a lit window","status":"pending"},{"content":"Checks, docs, notes, commit","status":"pending"},{"content":"Stop servers, close browser, remove launch entry","status":"pending"}],"scope":"continuation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GtGCydQHmsWbdqyWHLVAsD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/atmosphere.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    if ((surface === 'stone' || surface === 'wood') && panes.length) {\n      const g = paneAt(x, y, zz);\n      if (g) { add('glass', g.x, g.y, g.z, g.n.x, g.n.y, g.n.z, 0.24 + r * 0.14); return; }\n    }\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    if ((surface === 'stone' || surface === 'wood') && panes.length) {\n      const g = paneAt(x, y, zz);\n      if (g) {\n        add('glass', g.x, g.y, g.z, g.n.x, g.n.y, g.n.z, 0.24 + r * 0.14);\n        api.onGlass?.(g.x, g.y, g.z, g.n.x, g.n.z);\n        return;\n      }\n    }\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"\"\"  return { group, add, pin, impact, clear, setPanes };\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  // onGlass(x, y, z, nx, nz): a round went through a lit pane there (the shards are another's, main.js)\n  const api = { group, add, pin, impact, clear, setPanes, onGlass: null };\n  return api;\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='js/effects.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"  /* a wisp of steam off something hot in the rain\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  /* a round through a window's glass (facing nx, nz): shards of it broken out, glinting as they turn\n     in the room's light and the lamps', falling, most just below the pane, a few thrown out further;\n     a fleck or two catching the light brightly for a moment */\n  function glass(x, y, z, nx, nz) {\n    for (let k = 0, n = 10 + Math.floor(R() * 7); k < n; k++) {\n      const out = 0.2 + R() * R() * 2.2, side = (R() - 0.5) * 1.2;\n      alpha.spawn({\n        x: x + nx * 0.03 + (R() - 0.5) * 0.08, y: y + (R() - 0.5) * 0.08, z: z + nz * 0.03 + (R() - 0.5) * 0.08,\n        vx: nx * out - nz * side, vy: R() * 1.2 - 0.2, vz: nz * out + nx * side,\n        life: 0.9 + R() * 0.6, size: 0.012 + R() * 0.02, color: C('#d4dde2', 0.9), color1: C('#c3ccd2', 0.75),\n        cell: CELLS.chunk, gravity: 9.8, rot: R() * 6, rotV: (R() - 0.5) * 30,\n      });\n    }\n    for (let k = 0; k < 4; k++) {\n      add.spawn({\n        x: x + nx * 0.04, y: y + (R() - 0.5) * 0.1, z: z + nz * 0.04,\n        vx: nx * (0.5 + R()) + (R() - 0.5), vy: R() * 0.8, vz: nz * (0.5 + R()) + (R() - 0.5),\n        life: 0.08 + R() * 0.12, size: 0.01, color: C('#fff2d8', 1, 2.2), color1: C('#ffd8a0', 0, 1), cell: CELLS.spark, gravity: 9.8,\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* a wisp of steam off something hot in the rain\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"\"\"    group, muzzle, tracer, impact, blood, splash, explosion, addFire, smokePuff, shell, steam, flareLaunch, update, fires,\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    group, muzzle, tracer, impact, blood, splash, explosion, addFire, smokePuff, shell, steam, glass, flareLaunch, update, fires,\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='js/main.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"  // the lit windows' glass, for the cracks a bullet leaves in it\n  G.decals.setPanes(paneRects(built.props));\n\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  // the lit windows' glass, for the cracks a bullet leaves in it and the shards it breaks out\n  G.decals.setPanes(paneRects(built.props));\n  G.decals.onGlass = (x, y, z, nx, nz) => G.effects.glass(x, y, z, nx, nz);\n\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nfor f in atmosphere effects main; do cp js/$f.js $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs; node --check $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs && echo \"$f ok\"; rm -f $TMPDIR/chk_$f.mjs; done","description":"Add glass shards and hook them to pane hits"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
