{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"8c2d8db5-e3ee-43c3-97ab-66a96810e9a4","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:43:17.241Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"8e66906a-828d-4efe-9d29-1e10951d07b5","keep":275,"tail":["a160b4b3858cfe8e9aa3274cfd60dbbb1455d6df641db481c0744a3603f4d3a4","a68639bdc385782c17ff27c6c49fe164d1e669f88549c2b86a9e4f48c25a5909","a393f9d21620eb9cc437b01d21a16ccd09a66bc4f007dbf49df0c1f3b52ce33f"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",277,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"a57b7d75b0764256e8b374f97de76ea9c516965302f9732237be5e8ab1a286b2"}
{"parentUuid":"f4401f0e-d9f7-4fbf-beaf-8457728e3ad2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGMAqGNM3KRTGXrUFUKb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've committed this round as **556743c5**: wet white sheets now hang from four of the lit upper-floor windows facing the street. Each is on a different kind of house: the shop with the balcony, the stone house, the half-timbered one and the plaster one. It's committed only, not pushed.\n\nThe idea came from the Medal of Honor: Airborne street screenshot, where a big white cloth hangs over a dusk street. It's also historically right: during the fighting in Normandy, villagers hung white sheets from their windows to show civilians were inside.\n\n- **Where they hang:** each sheet hangs from the balcony rail or the window sill, and stops before anything sticking out of the wall below, like a shop sign.\n- **Look:** old linen, stained, creased, with grime streaks and a torn or frayed hem, darkened by the rain. It hangs in pleats that are darker in their folds.\n- **Motion:** the sheets swing away from the wall and ripple with the same gusts that move the trees. The movement is strongest at the hem and on the sheltered side of each house. Their shadows from the lamps and flares move with them.\n- **Cost:** about 8 ms at load, and 0.14–0.28 ms of GPU time with a sheet filling a fifth of the screen next to its lamp.\n\nProblems I hit and fixed:\n- The first sheets didn't show at all. I'd named a shader variable `out`, which is a reserved word, so the shader failed without any visible error.\n- After that they were hidden inside the walls, because the collision boxes sit about 25 cm behind the real house fronts. They're now placed against the houses' actual shapes.\n- That fix first took 480 ms at load. I rewrote the placement test to bring it down to 8 ms.\n\nChecks: no shader failures on the low, medium or high presets, the 9 node checks pass, and the commit merges cleanly with hedgerow-poc.\n\nI left out water dripping from the hems. A drip would start from a fixed point while the hem swings by up to 15 cm, so the drip would visibly drift away from the cloth.\n\nThe shared notes have this round's details. The test browser and server are stopped, and my `launch.json` entry is removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":299441,"output_tokens":712,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":299441,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"86ca3307-f72d-428f-bb77-afc897713d53","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGMApZCetRLuEkSdF15F","requestRef":"8c2d8db5-e3ee-43c3-97ab-66a96810e9a4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"6fd43431-9d03-43b4-aec3-539d67b9ec14","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:43:24.899Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
