{"parentUuid":"de2f4a22-5955-44d5-b524-212a1533db9f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01763QQVhfwQW6N5SHXPRddK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Call of Duty WWII campaign official screenshots Normandy village\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"dsogaming.com\",\"url\":\"https://dsogaming.com/?p=98066\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty: WWII Screenshots and Trailers\",\"url\":\"https://opencritic.com/game/4505/-/media\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty WWII présente sa campagne solo et son héros en vidéo\",\"url\":\"https://www.actugaming.net/?p=111924\"},{\"title\":\"Call of Duty WW2\",\"url\":\"https://www.dday-overlord.com/en/filmography/video-games/call-of-duty-ww2\"},{\"title\":\"two call duty wwii campaign missions detailed 42620\",\"url\":\"https://www.charlieintel.com/call-of-duty/two-call-duty-wwii-campaign-missions-detailed-42620/\"},{\"title\":\"More Call Of Duty: WW2 Campaign Details Revealed\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/articles/more-call-of-duty-ww2-campaign-details-revealed/1100-6452422/\"},{\"title\":\"69106 call duty wwii finally has trailer looks gorgeous\",\"url\":\"https://static.techspot.com/news/69106-call-duty-wwii-finally-has-trailer-looks-gorgeous.html\"},{\"title\":\"call of duty ww2 campaign details revealed\",\"url\":\"https://christianpost.com/news/call-of-duty-ww2-campaign-details-revealed.html\"},{\"title\":\"microsoft.com\",\"url\":\"https://microsoft.com/en-us/p/call-of-duty-wwii-pre-order/brr3mrscnmz7\"},{\"title\":\"call of duty wwii reveal trailer\",\"url\":\"https://gamingtrend.com/news/call-of-duty-wwii-reveal-trailer\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up any official screenshot of a Normandy village. It returned general Normandy campaign material instead.\n\n- **Media listings:** An OpenCritic media page lists official Carentan and story trailers, plus three unlabeled screenshots, but doesn't describe what they show. Call of Duty: WWII Screenshots and Trailers\n- **Normandy content:** The campaign's Normandy setting centers on the Omaha Beach landing. From inside a Higgins landing boat, your squad will storm Omaha Beach. Operation Cobra was also among the missions revealed. Some of the other missions include Operation Cobra (the Allied campaign into France)\n- **Early leaks:** The first in-game screenshots reportedly leaked from the official website, but these screenshots are really low-res.\n\nFor actual village screenshots, the official Call of Duty site, Activision's press kit, or the game's Steam or Xbox store pages would be the best places to check. I'd also suggest a more specific query, such as \"Call of Duty WWII Carentan screenshot,\" since Carentan is a Normandy town and the game has a trailer for it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2c670eb7-75f7-4a89-83f2-1892c840be47","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:44:23.542Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Call of Duty WWII campaign official screenshots Normandy village","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01852KiSn3e91DtSWGLapKgo","content":[{"title":"dsogaming.com","url":"https://dsogaming.com/?p=98066"},{"title":"Call of Duty: WWII Screenshots and Trailers","url":"https://opencritic.com/game/4505/-/media"},{"title":"Call of Duty WWII présente sa campagne solo et son héros en vidéo","url":"https://www.actugaming.net/?p=111924"},{"title":"Call of Duty WW2","url":"https://www.dday-overlord.com/en/filmography/video-games/call-of-duty-ww2"},{"title":"two call duty wwii campaign missions detailed 42620","url":"https://www.charlieintel.com/call-of-duty/two-call-duty-wwii-campaign-missions-detailed-42620/"},{"title":"More Call Of Duty: WW2 Campaign Details Revealed","url":"https://www.gamespot.com/articles/more-call-of-duty-ww2-campaign-details-revealed/1100-6452422/"},{"title":"69106 call duty wwii finally has trailer looks gorgeous","url":"https://static.techspot.com/news/69106-call-duty-wwii-finally-has-trailer-looks-gorgeous.html"},{"title":"call of duty ww2 campaign details revealed","url":"https://christianpost.com/news/call-of-duty-ww2-campaign-details-revealed.html"},{"title":"microsoft.com","url":"https://microsoft.com/en-us/p/call-of-duty-wwii-pre-order/brr3mrscnmz7"},{"title":"call of duty wwii reveal trailer","url":"https://gamingtrend.com/news/call-of-duty-wwii-reveal-trailer"}]},"The search didn't turn up any official screenshot of a Normandy village. It returned general Normandy campaign material instead.\n\n- **Media listings:** An OpenCritic media page lists official Carentan and story trailers, plus three unlabeled screenshots, but doesn't describe what they show. Call of Duty: WWII Screenshots and Trailers\n- **Normandy content:** The campaign's Normandy setting centers on the Omaha Beach landing. From inside a Higgins landing boat, your squad will storm Omaha Beach. Operation Cobra was also among the missions revealed. Some of the other missions include Operation Cobra (the Allied campaign into France)\n- **Early leaks:** The first in-game screenshots reportedly leaked from the official website, but these screenshots are really low-res.\n\nFor actual village screenshots, the official Call of Duty site, Activision's press kit, or the game's Steam or Xbox store pages would be the best places to check. I'd also suggest a more specific query, such as \"Call of Duty WWII Carentan screenshot,\" since Carentan is a Normandy town and the game has a trailer for it."],"durationSeconds":5.143397082999349,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0d08a418-e85c-4d9c-9735-07baff61aaa6","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"REDACTED","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"REDACTED","plat